---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../../components/SiteFooter.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | NoTaxOTCalculator"
  description="Privacy policy for NoTaxOTCalculator. Calculator inputs stay in your browser. Analytics only if configured."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <SiteHeader slot="header" />
  <div class="site-wrap prose-seo py-10">
    <h1 class="text-3xl tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-mute">Last updated: September 21, 2026</p>
    <p class="mt-4">
      NoTaxOTCalculator calculator pages run entirely in your browser. Filing status, hours, rates, tips, and MAGI estimates
      are not sent to our servers for calculation — there is no account system and no server-side tax engine.
    </p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      If a Google Analytics 4 measurement ID is configured via environment variable, anonymous usage analytics may load.
      Until then, no GA4 script is injected. We do not use AdSense or adsbygoogle on this site during the initial monitor-only period.
    </p>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>
      Static files may be hosted on Cloudflare Pages or similar CDN hosts, which may log standard request metadata
      (IP, user agent, path) for security and reliability.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Privacy questions: see <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>.</p>
  </div>
  <SiteFooter slot="footer" />
</BaseLayout>
